cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "szl_energy_attest"
abstract: >-
  Attestable energy receipts for governed compute. Turns a unit of governed
  compute into a canonical, hash-chained JSON receipt recording MEASURED-NVML
  joules (or an explicit UNAVAILABLE null when no GPU is present), cheapest-watt
  placement decisions, and optional live grid price / carbon — re-hashable and
  verifiable offline by anyone. Never fabricates a joule, a price, or a receipt.
type: software
